16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ13">&lt;img</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">src</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"images/range-rover.jpg"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">alt</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"Range Rover"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="569" data-end="581">For example:</p>
