}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="1pk2zlx" dir="auto" data-start="880" data-end="921">If your website is directly on GitHub</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="923" data-end="964">You can also upload the picture directly:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="966" data-end="1090"><strong data-start="966" data-end="1090">GitHub → your repository → <code data-start="995" data-end="1003">images</code> folder → Add file → Upload files → choose your Range Rover picture → Commit changes.</strong></p>
