.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="20573519-cfa6-4211-ad61-d6ea0f61cd48" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="194">Absolutely. You can replace your current <code data-start="41" data-end="53">index.html</code> with this complete simple <strong data-start="80" data-end="103">Range Rover website</strong>. It includes a <strong data-start="119" data-end="193">Range Rover picture, audio, navigation, information, and basic styling</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="bls1ml" dir="auto" data-start="196" data-end="236">1. Your folder should look like this</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="238" data-end="353"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>range-rover/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── images/
    ├── range-rover.jpg
    └── range-rover.mp3</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="355" data-end="432">Put your Range Rover picture in <code data-start="387" data-end="395">images</code> and rename it <strong data-start="410" data-end="431"><code data-start="412" data-end="429">range-rover.jpg</code></strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="434" data-end="502">Put your audio file in <code data-start="457" data-end="465">images</code> and rename it <strong data-start="480" data-end="501"><code data-start="482" data-end="499">range-rover.mp3</code></strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="504" data-end="507">
<h2 data-section-id="1tndexg" dir="auto" data-start="509" data-end="527"><span role="text">2. <code data-start="515" data-end="527">index.html</code></span></h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="529" data-end="593">Delete everything currently in your <code data-start="565" data-end="577">index.html</code> and paste this:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="595" data-end="2816"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#fa6359" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>HTML</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><div role="group" aria-label="Code block view" class="group/code-block-preview-toggle relative flex items-center gap-0.5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-press pointer-events-none absolute start-0 top-0 size-9 rounded-full motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-in-out translate-x-0 group-has-[[data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview]:hover]/code-block-preview-toggle:translate-x-[calc(100%+2px)] group-has-[[data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview]:focus-visible]/code-block-preview-toggle:translate-x-[calc(100%+2px)]"></div><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Code" aria-pressed="true" class="relative z-1 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full motion-safe:transition-colors text-token-text-primary" data-code-block-preview-toggle-code="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Preview" aria-pressed="false" aria-disabled="false" class="relative z-1 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full motion-safe:transition-colors text-token-text-primary" data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div data-custom-highlighting-behavior="boundary" class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="max-height: 56.25cqw; transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼu">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;html</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">lang</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"en"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;head&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">charset</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"UTF-8"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">name</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"viewport"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">content</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;title&gt;</span><span>Range Rover</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/title&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;link</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">rel</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"stylesheet"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"style.css"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/head&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;body&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;header&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>RANGE ROVER</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Luxury. Power. Adventure.</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/header&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;nav&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;a</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"#home"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>Home</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/a&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;a</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"#about"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>About</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/a&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;a</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"#design"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>Design</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/a&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;a</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"#contact"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>Contact</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/a&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/nav&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;main&gt;</span><span>

        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">id</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"home"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Welcome to Range Rover</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
                Range Rover combines luxury, comfort and powerful performance.
                It is designed for both city driving and adventure.
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;img</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">src</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"images/range-rover.jpg"</span><span>
                 </span><span class="ͼ12">alt</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"Range Rover vehicle"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">id</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"about"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>About Range Rover</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
                Range Rover is known for its luxury design, comfortable interior
                and strong off-road capability. The vehicle combines modern
                technology with a premium driving experience.
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">id</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"design"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Design</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
                The Range Rover has a clean and modern exterior design.
                Its interior provides a comfortable and premium environment
                for both drivers and passengers.
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;section&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Range Rover Audio</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Listen to the audio below:</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;audio</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">controls</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
                </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;source</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">src</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"images/range-rover.mp3"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">type</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"audio/mpeg"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
                Your browser does not support audio playback.
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/audio&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">id</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"contact"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Contact</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
                Thank you for visiting my Range Rover website.
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
                Created for my Web Development course.
            </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/main&gt;</span><span>


    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;footer&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span class="ͼz">&amp;copy;</span><span> 2026 Range Rover Website</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/footer&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/body&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="2818" data-end="2821">
<h2 data-section-id="1wem4pu" dir="auto" data-start="2823" data-end="2840"><span role="text">3. <code data-start="2829" data-end="2840">style.css</code></span></h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2842" data-end="2905">Now open your <code data-start="2856" data-end="2867">style.css</code>, delete the old code, and paste this:</p>
