0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="c2283900-33d5-4368-8224-5fe657deea94" data-turn-start-message="true" dir="auto" tabindex="0" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="74">Yes. I found a <strong data-start="15" data-end="44">burble/pops exhaust audio</strong> you can use for your website.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="76" data-end="255">A good option is the <strong data-start="97" data-end="133">ECUFiles “Burbles” sound example</strong>. Their page provides three MP3 examples specifically demonstrating exhaust burbles. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="218" data-content-reference-end="235"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 81px;"><a href="https://ecufiles.com/chiptuning-files/tuning-file-burbles/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://ecufiles.com/chiptuning-files/tuning-file-burbles/" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 81px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./burble_files/favicons"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Ecufiles</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="257" data-end="294"><span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="237" data-content-reference-end="351"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener">Burble Sound Example 1 — MP3<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#ba2866" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></span></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="296" data-end="333"><span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="353" data-content-reference-end="467"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener">Burble Sound Example 2 — MP3<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#ba2866" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></span></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="335" data-end="372"><span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="469" data-content-reference-end="583"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener">Burble Sound Example 3 — MP3<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#ba2866" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1w8xmgn" dir="auto" data-start="374" data-end="394">For your website</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="396" data-end="437">Download one of those MP3s and rename it:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="439" data-end="461"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>burble.mp3</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="463" data-end="494">Put it in your <code data-start="478" data-end="486">images</code> folder:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="496" data-end="604"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>range-rover/
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── images/
    ├── range-rover.jpg
    └── burble.mp3</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="606" data-end="633">Then use this in your HTML:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="635" data-end="860"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#fa6359" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>HTML</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><div role="group" aria-label="Code block view" class="group/code-block-preview-toggle relative flex items-center gap-0.5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-press pointer-events-none absolute start-0 top-0 size-9 rounded-full motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-in-out translate-x-0 group-has-[[data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview]:hover]/code-block-preview-toggle:translate-x-[calc(100%+2px)] group-has-[[data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview]:focus-visible]/code-block-preview-toggle:translate-x-[calc(100%+2px)]"></div><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Code" aria-pressed="true" class="relative z-1 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full motion-safe:transition-colors text-token-text-primary" data-code-block-preview-toggle-code="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Preview" aria-pressed="false" aria-disabled="false" class="relative z-1 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full motion-safe:transition-colors text-token-text-primary" data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-a71cf49c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div data-custom-highlighting-behavior="boundary" class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="max-height: 56.25cqw; transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Range Rover Burble Sound</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Listen to the aggressive exhaust sound:</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;audio</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">controls</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;source</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">src</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"images/burble.mp3"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">type</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"audio/mpeg"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
    Your browser does not support audio playback.
</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/audio&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="862" data-end="1117" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="862" data-end="886">One important thing:</strong> these are general burble/exhaust examples, not recordings specifically confirmed to be from a Range Rover. If you want the website to say <strong data-start="1025" data-end="1059">“Range Rover SVR Burble Sound”</strong>, I can find a Range Rover SVR-specific recording instead.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" acrobat-processed-response="Y" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed" acrobat-processed-response="Y"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.100